## Victory Conditions
The battle system's victory conditions are determined through:

1. Node Control
- Strategic network nodes must be captured and held
- Control is determined by damage dealt to nodes
- See @sub-battle-node-control.mdc for implementation details

2. Loss Tracking
- Track battalion losses and node control changes
- Calculate victory points based on control duration
- See @sub-battle-combat-implementation.mdc for damage calculations

3. Scoring System
- Points awarded for:
  - Node control duration
  - Enemy battalion elimination
  - Network control bonuses
- See @sub-battle-node-control.mdc for scoring details

4. Victory Determination
- Victory achieved through:
  - Total network control
  - Point threshold reached
  - Enemy force elimination
- See @sub-battle-combat-implementation.mdc for win condition checks

